1
00:00:00,491 --> 00:00:01,621
(Leonard:)Right, sorry. Sorry.

2
00:00:01,784 --> 00:00:04,874
- And stop apologizing all the time.
- Right. Sorry.

3
00:00:05,580 --> 00:00:07,460
(Penny:)All right, let's shoot stuff.

4
00:00:07,623 --> 00:00:09,963
Do you want me
to show you what to do?

5
00:00:10,126 --> 00:00:14,376
I play a lot of "Grand Theft Auto."
I think I know how to handle a gat.

6
00:00:14,797 --> 00:00:17,967
(Penny:)Wow, you are cute
when you get all gangsta.

7
00:00:29,937 --> 00:00:32,567
(Leonard:)So I've got a gunshot wound.

8
00:00:33,649 --> 00:00:35,819
(Leonard:)That's pretty badass.

9
00:00:36,152 --> 00:00:39,402
(Penny:)No, you've got a Reebok
with a gunshot wound...

10
00:00:39,572 --> 00:00:41,992
...and an ouchie on your pinky toe.

11
00:00:42,658 --> 00:00:44,498
(Leonard:)Hello? They gave me a Band-Aid.

12
00:00:44,660 --> 00:00:48,750
(Leonard:)Hospitals do not issue Band-Aids unless
it is medically necessary. That is the law.

13
00:00:51,167 --> 00:00:54,127
(Penny:)Well, thank you for a really cool evening.

14
00:00:54,420 --> 00:01:00,020
(Leonard:)Thank you for hiding my Star Wars
socks at the emergency room.

